## 17. Success metrics

### Customer metrics

- trial-to-paid conversion;
- prepaid reactivation rate;
- voluntary and involuntary churn;
- payment success rate;
- household-member conversion;
- affordability and customer-satisfaction scores;
- complaint rates concerning billing and sharing;
- upgrade rates from ad-supported or mobile tiers.

### Economic metrics

- net revenue per paid member equivalent;
- contribution profit per account and member;
- contribution margin by market and tier;
- payment cost as a percentage of billings;
- CDN cost per viewing hour;
- customer acquisition payback;
- lifetime contribution-to-CAC ratio;
- partner versus direct contribution;
- promotional subsidy dependence;
- FX effect on reported revenue and margin.

### Portfolio metrics

- percentage of markets above contribution floors;
- time from launch to positive contribution;
- cumulative investment in build markets;
- percentage of revenue on domestic payment rails;
- revenue concentration by tier and partner;
- number of uneconomic tier-rail combinations;
- share of account sharing converted to paid participation.

